          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika mwaka wa thelathini na tisa wa enzi ya mfalme Azaria wa Yuda, Menahemu mwana wa Gadi alianza kutawala Israeli, akatawala huko Samaria kwa muda wa miaka kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwasi Mwenyezi-Mungu siku zote za utawala wala hakuacha maovu ya Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, ambaye aliwapotosha watu wa Israeli wakatenda dhambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Pulu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Pulu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Katika 1Nya 5:26: Tiglath-pileseri.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mfalme wa Ashuru, aliivamia Israeli, naye Menahemu akampa kilo thelathini na nne za fedha ili amsaidie kuimarisha mamlaka yake juu ya nchi ya Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahemu alipata fedha hiyo kwa kuwalazimisha matajiri wa Israeli kutoa mchango wa shekeli hamsini za fedha kila mmoja. Halafu Pulu hakukaa Israeli bali alirudi katika nchi yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
