          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika mwaka wa hamsini wa enzi ya mfalme Azaria wa Yuda, Pekahia mwana wa Menahemu alianza kutawala Israeli, akatawala huko Samaria kwa muda wa miaka miwili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwasi Mwenyezi-Mungu na kufuata mfano mbaya wa mfalme Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, ambaye aliwafanya watu wa Israeli watende dhambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peka mwana wa Remalia, ambaye alikuwa ofisa wa jeshi la Pekahia, alishirikiana na watu wengine hamsini kutoka Gileadi, akamuua Pekahia katika ngome ya ndani ya nyumba ya mfalme huko Samaria, na kuwa mfalme mahali pake.",
