          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika mwaka wa pili wa enzi ya Peka mwana wa Remalia huko Israeli, Yothamu mwana wa Uzia mfalme wa Yuda alianza kutawala Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alikuwa na umri wa miaka ishirini na mitano alipoanza kutawala; alitawala huko Yerusalemu kwa muda wa miaka kumi na sita. Mama yake aliitwa Yerusha, binti Sadoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama vile Uzia baba yake, Yothamu alitenda mambo yaliyompendeza Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo, mahali pa kuabudia miungu ya uongo hapakuharibiwa, na watu waliendelea kutoa sadaka na kufukiza ubani kwenye mahali pa juu. Yothamu alijenga lango la kaskazini la nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
